    {
      "id": "2026-11-17-use-chat-write-ai-comments-suggestions-8bb4a1d5",
      "kind": "behavior",
      "summary": "Write AI comments and suggestions under the AI's own name. `use-chat` exports `aiUser`, sets `authorId: aiUser.id` on `AIChatTransportPlugin`, creates each generated comment as `aiUser` with `data.requestedBy` naming the editor's user and `data.model` naming the model the route streamed with it, and the editor and demos list `aiUser` among the comment users. `comment` lets the user in `requestedBy` resolve, reopen, edit and delete the AI's messages, and resolve and reopen stay with the thread's creator or that requester when its first message is removed.",
      "details": [],
      "migrationNotes": [
        "List aiUser from use-chat among the CommentsPlugin users so AI comments show its name, and let your mutate adapter accept the AI's ID as an author for the users allowed to run AI."
      ],
